OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 5, saves collapsed mum's
OL,4,Alife by calling 999
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-year-old girl from the Black
OL,7,FCountry who helped save her mum's life
OL,8,Fhas become the youngest person ever to
OL,9,Freceive a bravery award from West
OL,10,FMidlands Ambulance Service (WMAS).
OL,12,FMya Kaur Sangha, from Rowley Regis, was
OL,13,Fsaid to have calmly called 999 after
OL,14,Fher mum Neeta suddenly collapsed and
OL,15,Flost consciousness at home in February.
OL,17,FNeeta, who was looking after Mya and
OL,18,Fher two younger siblings, aged three
OL,19,Fand eight months, became seriously
OL,20,Funwell with suspected sepsis.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
