OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 5, saves collapsed mum's
OL,4,Alife by calling 999
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite being so young, Mya managed to
OL,7,Fcall an ambulance and give the
OL,8,Femergency call handler their home
OL,9,Faddress, her mum's name and the
OL,10,Fchildren's ages.
